   "discussion": [{"poster": "examuserss", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nCorrect Answer:\\nC. Use the AWS Copilot CLI to define the AWS Copilot pipeline and to deploy the AWS CodePipeline. Select CodeCommit as the source for the AWS CodePipeline.\\n\\nThis option is the most operationally efficient solution, as it makes full use of AWS Copilot's built-in capabilities to define and deploy the automated pipeline with minimal effort."}, {"poster": "preachr", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nhttps://aws.github.io/copilot-cli/docs/concepts/pipelines/"}, {"poster": "wh1t4k3r", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nBoth A and C work, the key word is efficiency. C is the most efficient way."}, {"poster": "65703c1", "content": "Selected Answer: A\\nA is the correct answer."}, {"poster": "a1971h", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nC ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"}],
