   "discussion": [{"poster": "608064a", "content": "Selected Answer: D\\nD. Add an X-Forwarded-For header to the HTTP server log configuration file.\\n\\nThe `X-Forwarded-For` header is used to capture the original client IP address when requests are routed through a load balancer like the ALB."}, {"poster": "cachac", "content": "Selected Answer: D\\nX-Forwarded-For: This header helps you accurately determine the public IP address of the client"}, {"poster": "65703c1", "content": "Selected Answer: D\\nD is the correct answer."}],
