   "discussion": [{"poster": "KennethNg923", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nThe AWS AppConfig Agent Lambda extension is specifically designed to provide easy access to AppConfig configurations from Lambda functions. It allows for dynamic updates without redeployment and requires minimal development effort."}, {"poster": "Anandesh", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nhttps://docs.aws.amazon.com/appconfig/latest/userguide/appconfig-integration-lambda-extensions.html"}, {"poster": "komorebi", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nAnsswer is B"}, {"poster": "albert_kuo", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nEnvironment variables have a size limit of 4 KB, which is insufficient for a 6 KB document."}],
