   "discussion": [{"poster": "Arnaud92", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nCan't use EBS volumes with Lambda, used with EC2 only."}, {"poster": "chris_spencer", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nConfigure a function to mount an Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system to a local directory\\n\\nhttps://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/configuration-filesystem.html"}, {"poster": "komorebi", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nAnsswer is c"}, {"poster": "albert_kuo", "content": "Selected Answer: C\\nC. Set up an Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system with mount targets in the central VPConfigure the Lambda functions to mount the EFS file system. Update the Lambda function execution roles to give the functions to access the EFS file system."}],
