   "key": "dva-q-407",
   "source": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/amazon/view/156646-exam-aws-certified-developer-associate-dva-c02-topic-1/",
   "number": 407,
   "question": "A company runs an application on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group. The application experiences variable loads throughout each day.\n\nThe company needs to collect detailed metrics from the EC2 instances to right-size the instances. The company also wants to monitor custom application metrics to ensure the application is performing efficiently.\n\nWhich solution will meet these requirements?",
   "options": [
    { "letter": "A", "text": "Install the AWS X-Ray agent on the instances. Configure the agent to collect the EC2 instance metrics and the custom application metrics." },
    { "letter": "B", "text": "Install the Amazon CloudWatch agent on the instances. Configure the agent to collect the EC2 instance metrics and the custom application metrics." },
    { "letter": "C", "text": "Install the AWS SDK in the application’s cade. Update the application to use the AWS SDK to collect and publish the EC2 instance metrics and the custom application metrics." },
    { "letter": "D", "text": "Configure AWS CloudTrail to capture and analyze the EC2 instance metrics and the custom application metrics." }
   ],
   "answer": "B",
   "answer_verified": true,
   "community_votes": ["B (100%)"],
   "discussion": [{"poster": "italiancloud2025", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nCloudWatch Agent te permite recopilar tanto m\u00e9tricas detalladas de las instancias EC2 (para ajustar su tama\u00f1o) como m\u00e9tricas personalizadas de la aplicaci\u00f3n, todo sin modificar el c\u00f3digo de la aplicaci\u00f3n."}],
   "service": "AWS Auto Scaling"
