   "discussion": [{"poster": "italiancloud2025", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nCodePipeline junto con CloudFormation StackSets facilita el despliegue de infraestructura en m\u00faltiples cuentas, y CodeBuild se adapta perfectamente para ejecutar los tests de integraci\u00f3n. Minimo esfuerzo administrativo"}, {"poster": "bp07", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nAnswer should be B."}, {"poster": "xdeveloper", "content": "Selected Answer: B\\nStackSets handle the deployment of resources to multiple accounts without the need for complex configurations.\\nCodePipeline and CodeBuild integrate seamlessly for CI/CD, providing a low-maintenance, fully managed solution."}],
   "service": "Amazon EC2"
